  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\frac{\\cos A}{3}=\\frac{\\cos B}{4}=\\frac{1}{5},-\\frac{\\pi}{2} < A < 0,-\\frac{\\pi}{2} < B < 0$ then value of $2 \\sin A+4 \\sin B$ is"
