  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints : $\\cos A=\\frac{3}{5} \\quad \\sin A=-\\frac{4}{5}$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\cos B=\\frac{4}{5} \\quad \\sin B=-\\frac{3}{5} \\\\\n& =2\\left(-\\frac{4}{5}\\right)+4\\left(-\\frac{3}{5}\\right)=-\\frac{20}{5}=-4\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
